WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.331 --> 00:00:03.900
[SOLIDARITY LANES]

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.016
[UKRAINE USED TO GROW ENOUGH FOOD]

00:00:06.288 --> 00:00:09.280
[TO FEED 400 MILLION PEOPLE]

00:00:09.472 --> 00:00:11.360
[RUSSIA'S UNPROVOKED INVASION]

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.392
[BLOCKADED
UKRAINIAN BLACK SEA PORTS]

00:00:13.424 --> 00:00:15.168
[FOOD SHIPMENTS STOPPED]

00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:16.480
[EXPOSING MILLIONS
OF PEOPLE WORLDWIDE]

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.925
[TO THE RISK OF HUNGER]

00:00:19.051 --> 00:00:20.480
[THE EUROPEAN UNION]

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.976
[TOGETHER WITH UKRAINE
AND THE REPUBLIC OF MOLDOVA]

00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:24.910
[HAVE SET UP THE SOLIDARITY LANES]

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.600
[TO OPEN
ALTERNATIVE TRANSPORT ROUTES]

00:00:28.674 --> 00:00:30.960
[THE SOLIDARITY LANES
HELPED EXPORT]

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.360
[OVER 15 MILLION TONNES
OF UKRAINIAN GRAIN SO FAR]

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.840
[THIS HELPS PUT FOOD ON THE TABLE]

00:00:35.908 --> 00:00:38.000
[AND REDUCE
THE PRICE OF FOOD WORLDWIDE]

00:00:38.091 --> 00:00:40.400
[WITH OUR PARTNERS
WE ARE NOW MOBILISING]

00:00:40.491 --> 00:00:42.960
[1 BILLION EUROS
TO BOOST THE SOLIDARITY LANES]

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.428
[TOGETHER WE HELP INCREASE
GLOBAL FOOD SECURITY]

00:00:45.451 --> 00:00:47.440
[AND PROVIDE A LIFELINE
FOR UKRAINE'S ECONOMY]

00:00:49.312 --> 00:00:52.010
[SOLIDARITY LANES]

